The agent runs on four triggers: a document is uploaded, a learner's registration status changes, an expiry alert window opens, or a site visit or EISA date is booked. Every report it produces follows one layout: Executive Summary with overall status, Gap Analysis matrix, specific NCRs, and a Corrective Action Plan naming who acts and by when.
