Build Roadmap, Decisions & Next Steps
Build in four phases, starting where mistakes recur most: onboarding documents and expiry dates.
1. Foundation: Set up the Google Drive folders and load the Master Document Register into a Google Sheet and expiry dates for staff, assessors and Mindworx company documents. Turn on expiry alerts.
2. Onboarding & Registration: Document checks, agreement set selection, SETA bulk upload and QCTO enrolment drafting.
3. Site visit files: QCTO monitoring, SETA verification, post-course and accreditation packs, with readiness scores.
4. EISA & B-BBEE: EISA readiness checklist, B-BBEE evidence packs and dashboard feeds.
